    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join our Discord</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Begin as a skeleton, fight, gather resources, and craft armor/weapons to upgrade your bones.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/320a658552a46a0c2d83c71fc08b89fd.poster.avif?t=1690996186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/320a658552a46a0c2d83c71fc08b89fd.webm?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/320a658552a46a0c2d83c71fc08b89fd.mp4?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/1f9a1b85731dc598d37ee6a7d1cd8f64.avif?t=1690996186\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The world of Skullborn is a <strong>persistent infinite procedurally generated</strong> universe that all players join.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/c01d8c0881fd8dbb11f6a2b69f913a0b.poster.avif?t=1690996186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/c01d8c0881fd8dbb11f6a2b69f913a0b.webm?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/c01d8c0881fd8dbb11f6a2b69f913a0b.mp4?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/26a521870ce1d13e2aed5d8623125e2e.avif?t=1690996186\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">As you explore you will find other players and their buildings, villages, and other creations. As well as able to create your own base with your friends.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/26087506c7a38382be168f4c8369b5bd.poster.avif?t=1690996186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/26087506c7a38382be168f4c8369b5bd.webm?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/26087506c7a38382be168f4c8369b5bd.mp4?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You will also find player created dungeons with valuable loot!</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/3e809b2a2774566273ccc189f6b8913e.poster.avif?t=1690996186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/3e809b2a2774566273ccc189f6b8913e.webm?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/3e809b2a2774566273ccc189f6b8913e.mp4?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Infinite players, world, and possibilities. Become anything in Skullborn.</h2></strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Begin as a skeleton, fight, gather resources, and craft armor/weapons to upgrade your bones.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/320a658552a46a0c2d83c71fc08b89fd.poster.avif?t=1690996186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/320a658552a46a0c2d83c71fc08b89fd.webm?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/320a658552a46a0c2d83c71fc08b89fd.mp4?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/1f9a1b85731dc598d37ee6a7d1cd8f64.avif?t=1690996186\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">The world of Skullborn is a <strong>persistent infinite procedurally generated</strong> universe that all players join.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/c01d8c0881fd8dbb11f6a2b69f913a0b.poster.avif?t=1690996186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/c01d8c0881fd8dbb11f6a2b69f913a0b.webm?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/c01d8c0881fd8dbb11f6a2b69f913a0b.mp4?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/26a521870ce1d13e2aed5d8623125e2e.avif?t=1690996186\" /></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">As you explore you will find other players and their buildings, villages, and other creations. As well as able to create your own base with your friends.</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/26087506c7a38382be168f4c8369b5bd.poster.avif?t=1690996186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/26087506c7a38382be168f4c8369b5bd.webm?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/26087506c7a38382be168f4c8369b5bd.mp4?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You will also find player created dungeons with valuable loot!</h2><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/3e809b2a2774566273ccc189f6b8913e.poster.avif?t=1690996186\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/3e809b2a2774566273ccc189f6b8913e.webm?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1841200/extras/3e809b2a2774566273ccc189f6b8913e.mp4?t=1690996186\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Infinite players, world, and possibilities. Become anything in Skullborn.</h2></strong>",
